  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "## v1.6.0 (minor)\n\nChanges since v1.5.0:\n\n- refactor: clear the analyzer findings on the line-ending change ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- test: combine the batch test path through the mock file system ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- fix: preserve the sources' line endings across every merge path [minor] ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- Add dotnet to TAGS.md ([@matt-edmondson](https://github.com/matt-edmondson))\n- Gate Dependabot auto-merge on CI actually being green ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- test: use the MSTest assertions the analyzers ask for ([@matt-edmondson](https://github.com/matt-edmondson))\n- fix: count the conflicts a manual block merge resolved [patch] ([@matt-edmondson](https://github.com/matt-edmondson))",
